            <li>The cream and charcoal styling and Bricolage Grotesque font was basically stolen from <a href="https://zen-browser.app/" target="_blank">Zen browser</a> (which incidentally is my favourite browser)</li>
            <li>My good friend and incredible UX designer, Dev Patel, has <a href="https://healthy-office-579727.framer.app/" target="_blank">a wonderful portfolio</a>, I stole the design of several of his components</li>
